From: Andrei Aldea <andrei@ti.com>
Date: Mon, 17 Aug 2026 11:20:35 -0500
Subject: Declare package metadata for older Setuptools

Jammy's Setuptools can compile the extension but does not understand the
dynamic version and package-selection tables in pyproject.toml. Supply the
same values to setup() so that Python modules and metadata are installed on
all supported suites.
---
 setup.py | 4 ++++
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+)

--- a/setup.py
+++ b/setup.py
@@ -58,6 +58,10 @@ class build_py(build_py_orig):  # pylint


 setup(
+    name="ml_dtypes",
+    version="0.5.4",
+    packages=["ml_dtypes"],
+    package_data={"ml_dtypes": ["py.typed"]},
     ext_modules=[
         Extension(
             "ml_dtypes._ml_dtypes_ext",
